meta {
  name: List Notifications
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/notifications
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  The bell feed, newest first: { results: [...], unreadCount }.

  Each row is { id, kind, actor: { id, name, avatarUrl }, checkin, comment,
  friendship, readAt, createdAt }. kind is one of like, comment,
  friend_request, friend_accepted; checkin ({ id, placeName }) is set for
  the first two, friendship ({ id, status }) for the last two, and comment
  ({ id, body }) only for a comment. Accepts limit (default 30, max 100)
  and `before`, an ISO 8601 createdAt cursor: pass the last row's
  createdAt to get the next page.

  To see something here, like or comment on this user's checkin as
  another test user, or send them a friend request.
}
